abstract: >
  Modular Nextflow suite developed in the Baud Lab (CRG/UPF, Barcelona) to reproduce
  the findings of the PhD thesis "Host genetics shapes crypt niche colonisation by keystone gut bacteria,
  influencing metabolic health."

